     A*=========================================================================
     A* Institution: Muskegon Community College
     A* Course:      CIS170 - Intro to RPG Programming
     A* Instructor:  Char Parker
     A* Project:     Project #10 - Student Exam Results
     A* File:        PRJ10DSPF.DSPF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        11/18/2020
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*   Interactive display file for the Student Exam Results inquiry
     A*   application. Defines two screen formats:
     A*   SCRN1: Prompts for a student number input (STUNO) and displays
     A*          a conditionally mapped validation error message (Ind 90).
     A*   SCRN2: Displays retrieved student information and test scores
     A*          utilizing REFFLD to inherit data attributes from WUEXAMP.
     A*
     A* Used By:     PROJECT10.RPGLE
     A*=========================================================================
     A
     A                                      REF(WUEXAMP)
     A                                      INDARA
     A          R SCRN1
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                  1 28'Wibaux University'
     A                                 13 18'Type value, then Press Enter.'
     A                                 10 18'Student Number . . . .'
     A            STUNO     R        I 10 41
     A  90                                  DSPATR(PC)
     A  90                                  ERRMSG('Invalid Student Number' 90)
     A                                 20  3'F3=Exit'
     A                                  1  2'User ID:'
     A                                  1 11USER
     A                                  1 69DATE(*JOB)
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                  2 27'Student Exam Results'
     A          R SCRN2
     A                                      CA03(03 'F3=Exit')
     A                                      CA12(12 'F12=Cancel')
     A                                  1 28'Wibaux University'
     A                                  2 27'Student Exam Results'
     A                                  1  2'User ID:'
     A                                  1 11USER
     A                                  1 69DATE
     A                                      EDTCDE(Y)
     A            SLNAME    R        O  6 45
     A                                  6 18'Last Name . . . . . . . .'
     A            SFNAME    R        O  7 45
     A                                  7 18'First Name . . . . . . . .'
     A            EXAM1     R        O  8 45EDTCDE(3)
     A                                  8 18'Exam 1 . . . . . . . . . .'
     A            EXAM2     R        O  9 45EDTCDE(3)
     A                                  9 18'Exam 2 . . . . . . . . . .'
     A            EXAM3     R        O 10 45EDTCDE(3)
     A                                 10 18'Exam 3 . . . . . . . . . .'
     A            EXAM4     R        O 11 45EDTCDE(3)
     A                                 11 18'Exam 4 . . . . . . . . . .'
     A            EXAM5     R        O 12 45EDTCDE(3)
     A                                 12 18'Exam 5 . . . . . . . . . .'
     A                                 15  4'Press Enter to continue.'
     A                                 18  2'F3=Exit'
     A                                 18 70'F12=Cancel'

